格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Install safety net for DeepSeek Harness: pre-install snapshots, one-click/automatic rollback, guarded boot, and incident reports that auto-trigger agent analysis. 中文: DeepSeek Harness 插件安装安全网（安装前自动快照、一键/自动回退、守护启动、事故报告自动触发 Agent 分析）。","id":"gh:1335799735","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugin-guard","slug":"lxzy-7/dsh-plugin-guard","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Install safety net for DeepSeek Harness: pre-install snapshots, one-click/automatic rollback, guarde"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"d boot, and incident reports that auto-trigger agent analysis. 中文: DeepSeek Harness 插件安装安全网（安装前自动快照、"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"一键/自动回退、守护启动、事故报告自动触发 Agent 分析）。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-guard"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> Install safety net for DeepSeek Harness: pre-install snapshots, one-click / automatic rollback, gu"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"arded boot, and incident reports that auto-trigger agent analysis.\n>\n> DeepSeek Harness 的插件安装安全网：安装前"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"自动快照、一键/自动回退、守护启动、事故报告自动触发 Agent 分析。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"### What it does"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"A bad plugin install can leave the app unable to boot, and fixing it by hand usually means digging t"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"hrough config files. This plugin automates the whole chain:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### How it detects problems (important to understand)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The guard does **not** statically inspect plugin code, and it does **not** try to \"test\" a plugin in"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" isolation. Detection works at three levels:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"1. **Snapshots are pure file copies.** Taking a snapshot just copies 5 config files (`package.json`,"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" `pnpm-lock.yaml`, `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, `cordis.yml`, `cordis.patch.yml`). No plugin is run, no be"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"havior is evaluated."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"2. **Boot-level detection does run the harness — with your plugin loaded.** The `boot-guard` script "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"starts the whole `dsh web` process (which loads every installed plugin, including the one you just a"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"dded) and then health-checks HTTP `/` within a timeout. If a plugin breaks boot — load error, startu"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"p crash, unresponsive server — the check fails, and the guard automatically kills the tree, rolls ba"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"ck to the last good snapshot, and retries once. So **yes**: to catch a boot-breaking plugin, the har"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"ness (and therefore that plugin) has to actually start. That is the one moment where \"running the pl"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"ugin\" is part of detection. Since v0.3.1 the check also confirms the **web client actually rendered*"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"* (a plugin crash that black-screens the page with an error leaves HTTP 200 up — the guard's client "},{"id":"p11s9","text":"reports render crashes, and the boot-guard rolls back instead of calling a black screen \"healthy\"); "},{"id":"p11s10","text":"incident reports additionally record the **dsh version per snapshot** and flag when a boot failure f"},{"id":"p11s11","text":"ollows a harness update that a profile rollback cannot undo. **Since v0.3.2, when rollback and the r"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"etry both fail** (a DSH update made a plugin incompatible), the boot-guard diagnoses the offending p"},{"id":"p11s13","text":"th fail** (a DSH update made a plugin incompatible), the boot-guard diagnoses the offending p [长行截断]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`. This is a standard **bundle plugin**: it joins the profile layer stack and takes "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"effect automatically. (Once published to npm, `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-plugin-guard` also w"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" automatically. (Once published to npm, `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-plugin-guard` also works.)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Enable guarded boot (strongly recommended):** launch through `scripts/boot-guard.ps1` (Windows) or"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" `scripts/boot-guard.sh` (macOS/Linux) instead of running `dsh web` directly. Example on Windows, in"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"d.sh` (macOS/Linux) instead of running `dsh web` directly. Example on Windows, inside your launcher:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**Optional CLI shim (covers manual terminal installs):** the package ships a `dsh-guard` bin (`scrip"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ts/guard-cli.js`). Put it on your PATH and run `dsh-guard snapshot` before `dsh plugin add <pkg>` fr"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"om a terminal, or wrap your own `dsh` wrapper with it. This covers installs that do not go through t"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"he in-process `tools.guard` hook."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**One-click manual rollback (Windows):** the package also ships `scripts/rollback.cmd`. After instal"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"l it lives at `$DSH_HOME/profiles/<profile>/node_modules/dsh-plugin-guard/scripts/rollback.cmd` — ri"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ght-click → *Create shortcut* (or copy the file anywhere) and double-click it to restore the last go"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"od snapshot of every profile and re-run `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`. Rollback also deletes any "},{"id":"p19s5","text":"orphaned bundle-plugin symlinks left in `node_modules` (pnpm never removes a stale `link:` entry — \""},{"id":"p19s6","text":"Already up to date\" — so the guard does it directly against the restored `package.json`). It works e"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"ven when the app cannot start, and it self-derives `DSH_HOME` when the environment does not set it."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Usage"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**Settings panel — 备份管理 (Backup Manager).** In the web UI, open **设置 (Settings) → 备份管理**: per-enviro"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"nment snapshot lists, **load a specific backup**, **create a manual snapshot**, and **set how many s"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"napshots each environment keeps (minimum 2)**. Since v0.3.0 the plugin also registers a **设置 → 插件 → "},{"id":"p21s4","text":"插件配置** settings card (rc.7 plugin-owned settings surface): it edits the same keep-count through the "},{"id":"p21s5","text":"harness `settings` service (schema-validated, revision-fenced), and the 备份管理 panel plus the CLI stay"},{"id":"p21s6","text":" in sync via `config.json`."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**Agent tools** (registered for every session in the profile):"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| `dsh_snapshot` | Manually snapshot one profile or all profiles |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Security notes"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- The plugin only reads/writes profile config files and snapshots; it never executes third-party cod"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"e. `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` restores only the locked dependencies recorded in the snapshot.\n"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"- Snapshots and incident reports are local files without credentials (credentials live elsewhere und"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"er `$DSH_HOME`, not in this directory layout).\n- Automatic rollback happens only when the boot healt"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"h check fails; the guard never silently changes config during normal runtime."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Known limitations"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- Incident auto-analysis covers **boot-failure class** incidents; for mid-session errors, run `dsh_r"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ollback action=incident` manually to produce the same report.\n- Bundle-plugin changes require a web "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"restart to take effect.\n- Corrupted session logs are a data problem and are out of scope for rollbac"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"start to take effect.\n- Corrupted session logs are a data problem and are out of scope for rollback."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### 安全说明"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- 本插件只**读写 profile 配置文件与快照**，不执行第三方代码；`pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` 只按快照锁文件还原。\n- 快照与事故报告是本地文件，不含凭"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"据(凭据在 `$DSH_HOME` 其他位置，不在此目录约定内)。\n- 自动回退只发生在\"启动健康检查失败\"时，运行期不会随意改动配置。"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
